 d cute characters with instruction from our librarian.\nThis program is i
 deal for\nchildren aged 6-12\n. Siblings and family members are also welco
 me to join in the activity.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal 
 information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under 
 the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The informa
