 ttention … will that be the inspiration she’s looking for?​"\nCather
 ine Little\npresents a reading from her picture book "\nJane and the Blue 
 Willow Princess\n" about author Jane Austen\, then leads a\nfun craft with
  air-dry clay.\nCraft materials will be provided.\nInformation Collection 
