DESCRIPTION:Love reptiles? Join us for a fun\, hands-on encounter with som
 e amazing cold-blooded creatures—and get the chance to hold an adult boa
  constrictor! The last 30 minutes of the program will be for a meet and g
 reet with the animals.\nHands on Exotics\, an exotic animal shelter\, will
  introduce a variety of furry\, feathery\, and scaly animals while sharing
  fascinating facts about wildlife\, conservation\, and responsible pet own
 ership.\nNote:\nTo help as many children as possible enjoy this program\, 
 we encourage children who are comfortable participating on their own to at
 tend without a parent or guardian whenever possible.\nFor kids ages 6+ Spa
 ce is limited.\nGentle Reminder:\nDue to high demand\, we kindly ask you t
 o arrive on time so everyone has a chance to participate. Spots may be off
 ered to those waiting after\n5 minutes.\nThank you for your understanding 
